#: ../../context.md:1
msgid "Context and caching"
msgstr "Context 与缓存"

#: ../../context.md:3
msgid ""
"Each request contains more than the latest message. minacode puts stable "
"session context first, then sends one append-only conversation log. This "
"keeps the agent informed while giving supported providers exact earlier "
"user and tool boundaries to reuse."
msgstr ""
"每次请求包含的不只是最新消息。minacode 先放置稳定的 session context，再发送一份 append-only "
"对话日志。这样既能让 agent 掌握完整信息，也让支持缓存的 provider 可以精确复用之前的 user 和 tool 边界。"

#: ../../context.md:7
msgid "What the model receives"
msgstr "模型会收到什么"

#: ../../context.md:11
msgid ""
"Times are local, written once when the session starts and again when it "
"resumes, so both you and the model read them without converting anything."
msgstr "时间使用本地时区，在会话开始时写入一次，恢复时再写一次，因此你和模型都不用做任何换算就能读懂。"

#: ../../context.md:14
msgid ""
"Tool definitions are sent beside this stack: built-in tools, `Skill` when"
" skills are installed, and the tools of <span class=\"marker\">currently "
"connected</span> MCP servers. Configured but disconnected servers cost "
"nothing. Reasoning the model returns is kept and replayed only where the "
"active provider expects it."
msgstr ""
"工具定义与这一叠消息一起发送：内置工具、安装了 skill 时的 `Skill`，以及<span "
"class=\"marker\">当前已连接</span>的 MCP "
"服务器的工具。已配置但未连接的服务器不占用任何开销。模型返回的推理内容会被保留，并只在当前 provider 需要时回放。"

#: ../../context.md:19
msgid ""
"[Provider-side search](tools.md#provider-side-tools) is the exception to "
"all of this: the pages it reads are added by the provider, so they are "
"neither shortened nor counted in the context fill, and most providers "
"bill the search on top of the tokens."
msgstr ""
"[Provider 侧搜索](tools.md#provider-side-tools) 是上面这些规则的例外：它读到的页面由 provider "
"加进来，既不会被缩短，也不计入上下文占用，而且大多数 provider 会在 token 之外另行收取搜索费用。"

#: ../../context.md:23
msgid "Keeping context manageable"
msgstr "控制 context 大小"

#: ../../context.md:25
msgid ""
"Large tool results are shortened before they enter the conversation; the "
"agent can retrieve the complete result later with `Recall`. Repeated "
"skill instructions and MCP descriptions are replaced with references to "
"their first full copy instead of being sent in full again."
msgstr ""
"过大的工具结果进入对话前会被缩短；agent 之后可以通过 `Recall` 取回完整结果。重复的 skill 指令和 MCP "
"描述不会再次完整发送，而是引用首次出现的完整内容。"

#: ../../context.md:29
msgid "Compaction"
msgstr "Compaction"

#: ../../context.md:31
msgid ""
"As a request approaches `runtime.max_context_tokens`, minacode "
"**compacts**: the older part of the conversation is replaced by a short "
"summary, and the most recent messages are kept as they are. The session "
"continues in the same turn, so a long task does not have to stop."
msgstr ""
"当一个请求接近 `runtime.max_context_tokens` 时，minacode "
"会**压缩**：较早的那部分对话被一段简短摘要取代，最近的消息按原样保留。会话在同一个回合里继续，因此一个长任务不必中断。"

#: ../../context.md:35
msgid ""
"About eight recent messages survive, so the last tool results and file "
"contents are still there and not only described. Very large ones keep "
"fewer, or the pass would free nothing."
msgstr ""
"最近大约八条消息会保留下来，所以最后几个工具结果和文件内容还在，而不只是被描述过。很"
"大的消息会保留更少，否则这次压缩等于什么都没腾出来。"

#: ../../context.md:38
msgid ""
"The threshold leaves room for what the next request carries besides the "
"conversation — the reply the model may write, and the tool definitions — "
"so compaction happens before the window is full. The fill shown in the "
"status bar measures the last request; compaction looks ahead to the next."
msgstr "这个阈值会为下一次请求里除对话之外要携带的东西留出余地——模型可能写出的回复，以及工具定义——所以压缩发生在窗口被填满之前。状态栏显示的占用衡量的是上一次请求，而压缩看的是下一次。"

#: ../../context.md:42
msgid ""
"The summary is lossy, so each compaction also stores a verbatim excerpt "
"of the messages it evicted, as a **history segment**. The session log "
"keeps the originals either way."
msgstr "摘要是有损的，因此每次压缩还会把它丢弃的那些消息按原样存成一段**历史片段**。无论如何，会话日志里都保留着原文。"

#: ../../context.md:47
msgid ""
"Each compaction names the span it evicted, in the same reply that writes "
"the summary, so the title describes the work rather than whichever "
"message happened to start the window. The agent reaches segments through "
"`RecallContext` — listing, searching, or retrieving one — and none of "
"them take up room in a request until it does."
msgstr ""
"每次压缩都会在写下摘要的那次回复里为它丢弃的这段对话命名，因此标题描述的是这段工作本身，而不是恰好位于窗口开头的那条消息。agent 通过 "
"`RecallContext` 访问这些片段——列出、搜索或取回其中一个——在它这么做之前，它们不会占用请求里的任何位置。"

#: ../../context.md:52
msgid ""
"Only the newest 50 segments stay recallable; a session that compacts more"
" often drops its oldest spans. `seg.N` keys keep counting, so the agent "
"is told a segment is gone rather than handed a different one."
msgstr ""
"只有最新的 50 个 segment 保持可取回；压缩次数超过这个数量的会话会丢弃最旧的片段。`seg.N` key 会继续递增，因此 agent"
" 得到的是该 segment 已不存在的答复，而不是另一个片段。"

#: ../../context.md:56
msgid ""
"Run `/compact` to compact immediately rather than waiting for the "
"threshold, for example before starting a large refactor. `/status` "
"reports how many compactions a session has done."
msgstr ""
"运行 `/compact` 可以立即压缩，而不必等待阈值；例如可在大型重构前使用。`/status` 会显示当前 session 已执行的 "
"compaction 次数。"

#: ../../context.md:59
msgid ""
"`/compact log` reviews them one by one. Each row shows when the pass ran,"
" whether it was automatic or manual, whether it covered prior "
"conversation or the running turn, and how much it evicted. Opening one "
"shows the summary written at that point — the active context keeps only "
"the newest — and `/compact log seg.N` prints that summary without the "
"viewer."
msgstr ""
"`/compact log` "
"可以逐个回顾它们。每一行显示这次压缩何时运行、是自动还是手动、覆盖的是先前对话还是当前回合，以及丢弃了多少内容。打开其中一个会显示当时写下的摘要——活动上下文只保留最新的那一份——`/compact"
" log seg.N` 则不经查看器直接打印该摘要。"

#: ../../context.md:64
msgid ""
"Neither form prints the stored excerpt — that is the agent's to retrieve "
"— and a pass that finds nothing to evict stores no segment at all, so the"
" compaction count can exceed the segment count."
msgstr "两种方式都不会打印已存储的逐字摘录——那是留给 agent 取回的；而没有可丢弃内容的那次压缩根本不会存储片段，因此压缩次数可能多于片段数量。"

#: ../../context.md:67
msgid ""
"While a summary is running, the status bar names the entry doing it — "
"`[compaction]`, then that entry's model and effort — the same way it "
"names an in-flight [worker](worker.md). The row goes back to the "
"conversation's own model when the summary lands, and does not change at "
"all when compaction runs on the model already shown."
msgstr ""
"摘要运行期间，状态栏会显示正在执行它的条目——先是 `[compaction]`，然后是该条目的模型与推理强度——就像它显示进行中的 "
"[worker](worker.md) 一样。摘要完成后，这一行会回到对话本身的模型；如果压缩就运行在已经显示的那个模型上，这一行不会有任何变化。"

#: ../../context.md:74
msgid "When a summary does not arrive"
msgstr "摘要没有拿到时"

#: ../../context.md:76
msgid ""
"Compaction always makes room, even when the summary request fails: the "
"same messages leave the context, with no summary written in their place. "
"Work is not lost — the segment is still stored and the agent can still "
"recall it — but the checkpoint carries less, so tell minacode what "
"matters if a long task continues past one."
msgstr ""
"即使摘要请求失败，压缩也一定会腾出空间：同样的消息会离开上下文，只是没有写下摘要。工作本身不会丢失——片段仍然存储着，agent "
"仍然可以取回——但检查点承载的信息更少，所以如果一个长任务要继续跨过它，请把要紧的事情再告诉 minacode 一次。"

#: ../../context.md:81
msgid ""
"`/compact log` marks such a pass `no summary`, and `/compact` reports the"
" reason on the spot. The usual causes are a summarizer that cannot fit "
"the span, one slower than its `response_timeout`, and a `[compaction]` "
"entry missing its url, key, or model — that last one is refused by name "
"before the request. Every failure names the entry that served it, so you "
"know where to look. See [Compaction model](configuration.md#compaction-"
"model) for choosing an entry that avoids all three."
msgstr ""
"`/compact log` 会把这样的一次标记为 `no summary`，`/compact` 则当场说明原因。常见原因"
"有三种：摘要模型装不下这一段、比它的 `response_timeout` 还慢、以及 `[compaction]` 配置"
"缺少 url、key 或 model——最后一种会在发请求之前就按名字拒绝。每一次失败都会点名是哪个 "
"entry 服务的，你就知道该去看哪里。见[压缩模型](configuration.md#compaction-model)，挑一"
"个三种都能避开的 entry。"

#: ../../context.md:87
msgid ""
"A weak summarizer sometimes writes something other than a summary. "
"minacode asks once more before giving up; if it keeps happening, the "
"`[compaction]` entry is too small for the job."
msgstr ""
"能力弱的摘要模型有时写出来的并不是摘要。minacode 会再问一次才放弃；如果反复出现，说明 "
"`[compaction]` 那个 entry 撑不起这份活儿。"

#: ../../context.md:90
msgid "Sessions started before these features"
msgstr "在这些功能之前开始的会话"

#: ../../context.md:92
msgid ""
"Resuming a session older than a given feature shows blanks rather than "
"errors. Segments compacted by an earlier version have no recorded time, "
"scope, or model, so `/compact log` lists them with `—` and says the "
"summary predates the log; summary tokens spent back then stayed in the "
"overall `usage` total, so `/status` shows no `compaction usage` row until"
" this session compacts again. Everything recorded from now on fills in "
"normally."
msgstr ""
"恢复一个早于某项功能的会话时，看到的是空白而不是报错。由更早版本压缩出的片段没有记录时间、范围和模型，所以 `/compact log` 会以 "
"`—` 列出它们，并说明摘要早于这份日志；那时花掉的摘要 token 留在总的 `usage` 里，因此在本次会话再次压缩之前，`/status`"
" 不会出现 `compaction usage` 这一行。从现在起记录的一切都会正常填入。"

#: ../../context.md:98
msgid "Spending less"
msgstr "更省钱"

#: ../../context.md:100
msgid "Four levers, in the order they usually pay off:"
msgstr "四个杠杆，按通常见效的顺序排列："

#: ../../context.md:102
msgid ""
"**Keep the cache prefix stable.** Switching models or connecting a server"
" mid-session restarts the reusable prefix; leaving them alone lets it "
"grow. See [Prompt caching](#prompt-caching)."
msgstr ""
"**保持缓存前缀稳定。** 会话中途切换模型或连接服务器会让可复用的前缀重新开始；不去动它们，前缀就会一直长下去。见[提示词缓存"
"](#prompt-caching)。"

#: ../../context.md:104
msgid ""
"**Give summaries a cheap model — or leave them where they are.** A small "
"model summarizes as well as a large one, so a separate entry costs less "
"per token. But a summary that stays on the conversation's own entry "
"reuses the cache the turn just filled, and one sent elsewhere pays for "
"the whole span. The `compaction cache` row of `/status` says which is "
"winning. See [Compaction model](configuration.md#compaction-model)."
msgstr ""
"**把摘要交给便宜的模型——或者就让它留在原地。** 小模型总结得并不比大模型差，所以另配一"
"个 entry 单价更低。但留在对话自己那个 entry 上的摘要，会复用这一轮刚填好的缓存；发去别"
"处则要为整段重新付钱。`/status` 的 `compaction cache` 一行会告诉你哪边占上风。见[压缩模"
"型](configuration.md#compaction-model)。"

#: ../../context.md:109
msgid ""
"**Delegate bounded work to a cheap [worker](worker.md).** Its tokens are "
"billed at the worker entry's rate, and its context never enters the "
"parent's."
msgstr ""
"**把有界的工作委派给便宜的 [worker](worker.md)。** 它的 token 按 worker "
"条目的价格计费，而且它的上下文不会进入父会话。"

#: ../../context.md:111
msgid ""
"**Size `runtime.max_context_tokens` to the work.** A larger window means "
"fewer compactions but a more expensive request every turn."
msgstr "**按工作量设置 `runtime.max_context_tokens`。** 更大的窗口意味着更少的压缩，但每一回合的请求都更贵。"

#: ../../context.md:114
msgid ""
"`/status` shows what each is doing: cache ratio, conversation usage, and "
"summary usage and cache on their own rows."
msgstr "`/status` 会显示它们各自的情况：缓存命中率、对话用量，以及摘要的用量和缓存，各占一行。"

#: ../../context.md:117
msgid "Prompt caching"
msgstr "Prompt 缓存"

#: ../../context.md:119
msgid ""
"Prompt caching lets a provider reuse work for an unchanged beginning of a"
" request. Each request usually starts with the same instructions, "
"environment, tools, and earlier conversation, so only the new tail needs "
"processing."
msgstr "提示词缓存让 provider 复用请求中未改变的开头部分。每次请求通常都以相同的指令、环境、工具和更早的对话开始，因此只有新的尾部需要处理。"

#: ../../context.md:125
msgid ""
"A request is reused only up to its first difference, which is why the "
"stable sections come first. Anything that changes an early one — "
"connecting an MCP server, installing a skill, switching models, enabling "
"a provider-side tool — shortens the reusable prefix; a compaction "
"deliberately starts a new one. Appending to the conversation, including "
"Note updates and resume events, does not."
msgstr ""
"请求只会被复用到第一处差异为止，这也是稳定的部分排在最前面的原因。任何改变靠前部分的动作——连接 MCP 服务器、安装 skill、切换模型、启用"
" provider 侧工具——都会缩短可复用的前缀；一次压缩则会有意开启一个新的前缀。向对话追加内容（包括 Note 更新和恢复事件）不会。"

#: ../../context.md:131
msgid ""
"A summary reuses this prefix too, as long as it runs on the "
"conversation's own entry. It is the largest request a session makes, "
"which is why sending summaries elsewhere is not free."
msgstr ""
"摘要也会复用这条前缀，只要它跑在对话自己的 entry 上。它是一个 session 里最大的一次请求"
"，这就是把摘要发去别处并非免费的原因。"

#: ../../context.md:134
msgid ""
"Support differs by provider. OpenAI-compatible endpoints may match "
"prefixes on their own, all the way through the conversation. Anthropic "
"caches only what it is told to, and minacode marks the instructions and "
"tools — so there the conversation itself is processed again each turn."
msgstr ""
"各家 provider 的支持并不相同。OpenAI 兼容端点可能自己匹配前缀，一路匹配到对话内容。"
"Anthropic 只缓存被明确告知的部分，而 minacode 标出的是指令和工具——所以在那里，对话本身"
"每一轮都会被重新处理。"

#: ../../context.md:138
msgid "Checking the hit rate"
msgstr "检查命中率"

#: ../../context.md:140
msgid ""
"`/status` reports the ratio for the latest request and for the whole "
"session, with cache-write tokens when the provider exposes them:"
msgstr "`/status` 会报告最近一次请求以及整个会话的命中率；当 provider 提供缓存写入 token 时也一并显示："

#: ../../context.md:145
msgid ""
"The latest-request ratio also shows live in the status bar, beside the "
"context fill, updating with each response."
msgstr "最近一次请求的命中率也会实时显示在状态栏中，紧跟上下文占用，随每次响应更新。"

#: ../../context.md:148
msgid ""
"The ratio varies with the provider, model, prompt length, and "
"conversation. When request prefixes line up, it <span "
"class=\"marker\">can reach 90–99%</span>. This is an observation, not a "
"guaranteed rate."
msgstr ""
"命中率会随 provider、模型、prompt 长度和对话变化。当前缀保持一致时，<span class=\"marker\">可达到 "
"90–99%</span>。这是观察值，不是保证值。"

