#~ "conversation history 之后并会原样保留，因此值得保留的决定应写入那里。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`/status` reports the cached prompt "
#~ "tokens the provider counted — once "
#~ "for the whole session, and again "
#~ "for the most recent request:"
#~ msgstr "`/status` 会显示 provider 统计的缓存 prompt token：一组是整个 session，另一组是最近一次请求："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "[Provider-side tools](tools.md#provider-side-"
#~ "tools) are sent beside them when "
#~ "configured, and what they return is "
#~ "different in kind: a web search's "
#~ "results are placed in the model's "
#~ "context by the provider, not by "
#~ "minacode. They are not shortened, they"
#~ " do not pass through `Recall`, and"
#~ " the context fill cannot anticipate "
#~ "them — a searching turn can arrive"
#~ " noticeably larger than the same turn"
#~ " without one. Some providers also "
#~ "replay their own search results on "
#~ "later turns, where they count as "
#~ "input tokens again, and bill each "
#~ "search separately from tokens."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "配置后，[Provider 侧工具](tools.md#provider-side-"
#~ "tools)也会一并发送，而它们返回的内容性质不同：联网搜索的结果由 Provider 而非 "
#~ "minacode 放入模型 context。这些内容不会被截断，也不经过 "
#~ "`Recall`，context 占用无法提前预估——包含搜索的一轮可能明显比不含搜索的同一轮更大。部分 "
#~ "Provider 还会在后续轮次重放自己的搜索结果，届时会再次计入输入 token，并且每次搜索会在 "
#~ "token 之外单独计费。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The environment records the session's "
#~ "start time once as a local ISO "
#~ "timestamp with its numeric offset, such"
#~ " as `2026-07-30T20:34:56+08:00`. Resuming appends"
#~ " a user-role lifecycle event with "
#~ "the new local time. These timestamps "
#~ "are directly readable by both the "
#~ "user and model; no UTC conversion "
#~ "is required, and there is no "
#~ "changing date block inserted into later"
#~ " requests."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "环境只记录一次 session 开始时间，使用带数字时区偏移的本地 ISO 时间戳，例如"
#~ " `2026-07-30T20:34:56+08:00`。恢复 session 时，会追加一条包含新本地时间的"
#~ " user-role 生命周期事件。用户和模型都能直接理解这些时间，无需转换 "
#~ "UTC，后续请求中也不会插入不断变化的日期块。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When a model exposes reasoning, minacode"
#~ " keeps the returned protocol data in"
#~ " the session but only replays what"
#~ " the active provider expects. Some "
#~ "APIs require preserved reasoning across "
#~ "turns; others ignore old reasoning "
#~ "unless a preserved-thinking option is"
#~ " enabled, while still needing it "
#~ "inside a multi-step tool call. "
#~ "Opaque signatures and encrypted reasoning "
#~ "are returned unchanged when their "
#~ "protocol requires them, but are not "
#~ "shown as model-readable text."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当模型返回 reasoning 时，minacode 会在 session "
#~ "中保留协议数据，但只回放当前 provider 所需的内容。部分 API 要求跨轮保留"
#~ " reasoning；另一些 API 除非启用 preserved-thinking"
#~ " 选项，否则会忽略旧 reasoning，但在多步工具调用期间仍需要它。协议要求时，不透明签名与加密 "
#~ "reasoning 会原样回传，但不会被当作模型可读文本显示。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The context fill shown in the "
#~ "status bar and `/status` is the "
#~ "provider-reported token count of the "
#~ "last request; compaction still triggers "
#~ "on the estimate, which projects the "
#~ "next request."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "状态栏与 `/status` 显示的上下文占用是最近一次请求的 provider 上报"
#~ " token 数；压缩仍按估算触发，因为估算描述的是下一个请求。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Segment titles do not occupy every "
#~ "request. The agent uses `RecallContext` "
#~ "to list them newest first, regex-"
#~ "search stored titles and text, or "
#~ "retrieve selected `seg.N` excerpts. `Note` "
#~ "can view the current goal, plan, "
#~ "facts, and checks; updates remain "
#~ "visible in their original tool-call "
#~ "history until a compaction checkpoint "
#~ "consolidates the complete current state."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Segment 标题不会占据每次请求。Agent 使用 `RecallContext` "
#~ "按从新到旧的顺序列出标题、通过正则搜索已存储的标题和文本，或取回指定的 `seg.N` 摘录。`Note` "
#~ "可以查看当前 goal、plan、facts 和 checks；在 compaction"
#~ " checkpoint 汇总完整当前状态之前，更新会保留在原始 tool-call "
#~ "history 中。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Neither form prints the stored excerpt"
#~ " of the evicted messages; that is "
#~ "the agent's to retrieve with "
#~ "`RecallContext`."
#~ msgstr "两种方式都不会打印已丢弃消息的逐字摘录：那是留给 agent 用 `RecallContext` 取回的。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Prompt caching lets a provider reuse "
#~ "work for an unchanged beginning of "
#~ "a request. The next request usually "
#~ "begins with the same instructions, "
#~ "environment, tools, and earlier conversation,"
#~ " so only the new tail needs to"
#~ " be processed. Note updates and "
#~ "resume events append to the conversation"
#~ " and therefore do not move an "
#~ "earlier breakpoint. A compaction intentionally"
#~ " starts one new cache epoch. "
#~ "Connecting an MCP server, changing "
#~ "installed skills, switching models, or "
#~ "otherwise changing an early section can"
#~ " reduce the next request's cache hit."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Prompt 缓存允许 provider "
#~ "复用请求开头未变化部分的计算。下一次请求通常以相同的指令、环境、工具和早期对话开始，因此只需处理新增的尾部。Note 更新和"
#~ " resume 事件会追加到对话中，因此不会移动更早的 breakpoint。一次 "
#~ "compaction 会有意开启新的 cache epoch。连接 MCP "
#~ "server、改变已安装的 skill、切换模型或修改前部内容，都会降低下一次请求的缓存命中。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "OpenAI-compatible providers may reuse "
#~ "matching prefixes automatically; minacode "
#~ "supplies a stable cache key where "
#~ "the provider supports one. For "
#~ "Anthropic, minacode explicitly marks the "
#~ "tools and system instructions as an "
#~ "ephemeral cacheable prefix. Provider support"
#~ " and accounting differ."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "OpenAI-compatible provider 可以自动复用匹配的前缀；provider "
#~ "支持时，minacode 会提供稳定的 cache key。对于 "
#~ "Anthropic，minacode 会显式将工具和 system 指令标记为临时可缓存前缀。不同"
#~ " provider 的支持方式和统计口径可能不同。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Give summaries a cheap model.** "
#~ "Compaction re-reads a large span "
#~ "every time it runs, and a small"
#~ " model summarizes it as well as "
#~ "a large one. See [Compaction "
#~ "model](configuration.md#compaction-model)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**把摘要交给便宜的模型。** "
#~ "压缩每次运行都要重新读一大段对话，而小模型总结得并不比大模型差。见[压缩模型](configuration.md"
#~ "#compaction-model)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Support differs by provider: OpenAI-"
#~ "compatible endpoints may match prefixes "
#~ "on their own, and minacode marks "
#~ "the cacheable prefix explicitly for "
#~ "Anthropic."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "各家 provider 的支持并不相同：OpenAI 兼容端点可能自己匹配前缀，而对 "
#~ "Anthropic，minacode 会显式标出可缓存的前缀。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The recent messages are kept for "
#~ "continuity — the last tool results "
#~ "and file contents, not just the "
#~ "summary's prose — so around eight "
#~ "of them survive, along with the "
#~ "request they belong to. Very large "
#~ "ones keep fewer: a handful of "
#~ "enormous tool results would fill the "
#~ "room the pass was meant to free,"
#~ " so the kept tail is bounded by"
#~ " size as well as count and "
#~ "collapses to the latest exchange when"
#~ " it has to."
#~ msgstr "保留最近这些消息是为了连续性——留下的是最后几个工具结果和文件内容，而不只是摘要里的几句话——所以大约有八条会活下来，连同它们所属的那次请求。很大的消息会留得更少：几个巨大的工具结果会把这次压缩本该腾出的空间重新占满，所以保留的尾部同时受条数和大小约束，必要时会收缩到只剩最后一轮。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A weaker summarizer sometimes answers "
#~ "the wrong question instead: it continues"
#~ " the conversation it was handed, or"
#~ " copies it back rather than "
#~ "describing it. Both are asked once "
#~ "more with a correction before the "
#~ "pass gives up, and where the "
#~ "provider supports it the reply is "
#~ "additionally constrained to be a JSON"
#~ " object. A repeat offender here is"
#~ " a sign the `[compaction]` entry is"
#~ " smaller than the job."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "能力较弱的摘要模型有时不是失败，而是答错了题：它会接着往下写这段对话，或者把对话原样抄回来，而不是描述它。这两种都会带上一句纠正再问一次，然后才放弃这一轮；在支持的"
#~ " provider 上，回复还会被额外约束成一个 JSON 对象。如果这里反复出现，说明 "
#~ "`[compaction]` 那个 entry 比这份活儿小。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The summary request rides that prefix"
#~ " too, when it runs on the "
#~ "conversation's own entry: it is that "
#~ "conversation's request with one instruction"
#~ " appended rather than a separate "
#~ "request built from scratch. It is "
#~ "the largest request a session makes, "
#~ "so this is where reuse is worth"
#~ " the most — and why sending "
#~ "summaries elsewhere is not free. Its "
#~ "hit rate has its own `/status` "
#~ "row."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "摘要请求同样骑在这条前缀上——只要它跑在对话自己的 entry "
#~ "上：它是拿这次对话的请求加一条指令拼成的，而不是另起炉灶重新构造一个请求。它是一个 session "
#~ "里最大的一次请求，所以复用在这里最值钱——这也是把摘要发去别处并非免费的原因。它的命中率在 `/status` "
#~ "里单独占一行。"

